# The WordPress blog. It is a separate application served by the origin server
# at /blogs — see the README. Three reasons it is not tracked here:
#   1. 159 MB, almost all of it WordPress core (wp-admin, wp-includes).
#   2. `blogs/wp-config.php` contains live database credentials.
#   3. Its content lives in MySQL, so the files alone would not restore it.
# It is backed up by the host, not by this repository.
blogs/
